ind":"update","title":"Destruction Snake Demo Update: More Languages & Difficulty Options!","summary":"Dear players,I'm happy to share another update for Destruction Snake!First of all, I'd like to thank everyone who has recently added Destruction Snake to their wishlist, as well as everyone who has downloaded and played the Demo. Seeing more people discover and take an interest in this game has been incredibly encouraging.I've continued working on improving the game, with the goal of making it more enjoyable and giving players more ways to experience it at their own pace.Here's what's new in thi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T17:45:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033692","verified_at":"2026-10-22T18:48:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5159080-1846651706676972","game_id":"steam-5159080","kind":"update","title":"Destruction Snake Demo Update: Better Progression, UI & Visuals","summary":"Dear players,I'm very happy to share another update for Destruction Snake!In our previous update, we reworked the game's core gameplay. This time, we've focused on making in-run progression more satisfying, improving the UI, and refining the game's visuals.The improvements are easy to see, and I believe they make a real difference. From the overall gameplay experience and sense of progression to the visual presentation, the game has taken another noticeable step forward.Of course, there are stil","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T09:40:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706676972","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:32:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5159080-1845383656397317","game_id":"steam-5159080","kind":"update","title":"Destruction Snake Demo – A Major New Update","summary":"Dear players,Thank you. Every one of you who has played this game means a great deal to me.This is an important update for Destruction Snake. Over the past period, I have been working hard to make the game more fun and to give its gameplay more depth.A large amount of new content and several new mechanics have been added in this update. Because of that, players who played earlier versions of the Demo may find some parts unfamiliar at first, and may need a little time to get used to the changes.B","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T18:27:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397317","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:32:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5159080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:06:10Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:06:10Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5159080":"2026-10-26T09:06:10Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5159080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:06:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:06:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:06:10Z"},"5230990":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:06:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:06:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:06:10Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5159080","app_id":5159080,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"8f77c980a66c95749766f9a5da3534b362d743065a04c73cadbe9ef0dd820aee","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"In Destruction Snake, you start with